##### Decision Variables

Let $x_i \geq 0$ denote the production quantity (units per week) of product $i$, for each product $i$ in the set of all products listed below.

##### Objective Function

Maximize weekly net profit:
$$
\max \left\{ \sum_{i} \left[ (\text{Selling Price}_i - \text{Variable Cost}_i) \cdot x_i \right] - 4500 \right\}
$$

##### Constraints

1. **Labor Capacity Constraint:**
$$
\sum_{i} (\text{Labor per unit}_i) \cdot x_i \leq 1650
$$

2. **Material Capacity Constraint:**
$$
\sum_{i} (\text{Material per unit}_i) \cdot x_i \leq 1850
$$

3. **Nonnegativity:**
$$
x_i \geq 0 \quad \forall i
$$

