##### Variable and Parameter Definitions

- $x_i$: production quantity of product $i$ (continuous, $\geq 0$)
- $\text{Labor per unit}_i$: labor required per unit of product $i$ (see table above)
- $\text{Material per unit}_i$: material required per unit of product $i$ (see table above)
- $\text{Selling Price}_i$: selling price per unit of product $i$ (see table above)
- $\text{Variable Cost}_i$: variable cost per unit of product $i$ (see table above)

##### Complete Model

Maximize:
$$
\sum_{i} \left[ (\text{Selling Price}_i - \text{Variable Cost}_i) \cdot x_i \right] - 4500
$$

Subject to:
$$
\sum_{i} (\text{Labor per unit}_i) \cdot x_i \leq 1650
$$
$$
\sum_{i} (\text{Material per unit}_i) \cdot x_i \leq 1850
$$
$$
x_i \geq 0 \quad \forall i
$$

